class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">428</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">29</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">“博······博士！它······在动，有什么东西长出来了······”</span></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">“······是蛇······是蛇呀！”</span></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">“博士，救命！博士！快救我啊啊啊啊啊！”</span></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">“好了！别大惊小怪，你先出去吧！”</span></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">“不过是一段脊骨而已······让我好好见识一下吧，你还有什么秘密？”</span></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">“噬界的<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">······</span>「舍沙」。”</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">不灭骨棘</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"background-color:#fff\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:20秒]展开十字架【召唤物】：生成持续16秒的蛇影领域，每3秒对其中敌人造成5*40.0%攻击力的雷电元素伤害，并对被命中敌人释放标记，角色分支攻击会消耗标记并额外造成一次400.0%攻击力的雷电元素伤害（伤害来自于角色）。蛇影领域中的敌人移动速度降低20.0%</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">宿恶心渊</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"background-color:#fff\">雷电元素伤害提高45.0%，攻击处于蛇影领域内的敌人时，雷电元素伤害额外提高15.0%</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">噬界利齿</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">分支攻击全伤害提高30.0%，分支攻击命中目标后，角色移动速度提高15.0%，受全伤害降低15.0%，持续6秒，可刷新。无限 · 噬界之蛇使用时，【起源之种】数量为0时回复1颗【起源之种】，冷却时间10秒</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"forging\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--forging obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>悬赏锻造</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">超限素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/980/detail\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/10/30/50494840/cd59193140dae89f95c6999d8385094d_2751387262368443757.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">解锁「往世的蛇影」图鉴后任意十字架蛋池武器</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">其他素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-other-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1274/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">爱因斯坦环磁机</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*100</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1140/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">超导金属氢</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*50</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1890/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">流体合金块</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*4</span></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div></div><div cl