iv><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/10/30/50494840/ab813c190925db9b40587c0ae4fc721e_8008754236383646758.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">超限后在强化原本属性的同时增加了分支攻击全伤害提高的效果，同时分支攻击命中后提供移速加成和减伤，武器主动也增加了减速效果，在提升伤害的同时也优化了输出环境，梅比乌斯使用时还可回复起源之种，进一步改善了输出循环。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/10/30/50494840/ab813c190925db9b40587c0ae4fc721e_8008754236383646758.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
